  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You emanate a 10-foot aura of arcane interference. A creature using Wild Shape in the aura must make a DC 14 Wisdom saving throw at the start of each of its turns or revert to its true form. Nature spells cast through or into the aura have healing reduced by half. Beasts and plant creatures within the aura cannot use Multiattack and have disadvantage on Wisdom saving throws.</p>",
